SUMMARY:🎶 Rob Satori Live in Concert 🎶
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🎶 Rob Satori Live 
 in Concert 🎶\n\n**Sunday\, August 23 • 1:00 PM**\n💵 **Suggested Do
 nation: $20 – No One Turned Away**\n\nJoin us for an inspiring afternoon
  of original music with **award-winning singer-songwriter Rob Satori**\, w
 hose heartfelt songs and uplifting performances have touched audiences acr
 oss the country.\n\n🏆 Rob has received **First Place Posi Awards** from
  emPower Music for his songs **"Let There Be Light"** and **"Bright Size L
 ife\,"** honoring music that inspires positive transformation.\n🎵 Durin
 g this special concert\, you'll experience:\n\n* 🎤 Soulful original son
 gs filled with hope\, heart\, and inspiration\n* 🎶 Rich melodies\, mean
 ingful lyrics\, and an engaging live performance\n* 💛 A welcoming commu
 nity gathering where music becomes a spiritual experience\n* 🌟 An oppor
 tunity to connect through songs that uplift\, heal\, and inspire\n\nRob's 
 music is available worldwide on Spotify\, YouTube\, Broadjam\, AudioSparx\
 , and other streaming platforms\, but nothing compares to hearing these so
 ngs performed live.\n\n✨ Make a Day of It!\n\nRob will also be the featu
 red musical guest during our **11:00 AM Sunday Celebration Service** along
 side **Rev. Dr. Suzi Schadle**. Following the service\, enjoy a catered lu
 nch before the concert begins at **1:00 PM**.\n\n💚 **Suggested Concert 
 Donation:** $20\nEveryone is welcome\, and **no one will be turned away du
 e to financial circumstances.**\n\nCome be nourished by music\, community\
 , and Spirit in an unforgettable afternoon.\n\n📅 **Sunday\, August 23**
 \n🕐 **Concert Begins: 1:00 PM**\n📍 **Center for Spiritual Living Ash
 eville**\n\n#RobSatori #LiveMusic #OriginalMusic #PosiAwards #CenterForSpi
 ritualLivingAsheville #CSLAsheville #CommunityCommonsAsheville #InspiredLi
 ving #SpiritualCommunity #AshevilleEvents #ConsciousMusic #SingerSongwrite
 r #LiveConcert #MusicThatHeals
