SUMMARY:🌕 Full Moon in the Golden Light: A Sound Bath of Reflection & R
 enewal 🌕
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🌕✨ Full Moon in 
 the Golden Light: A Sound Bath of Reflection & Renewal ✨🌕**\n\nAs the
  Full Moon rises over the warm days of late summer\, it gently illuminates
  all that has grown within us. Just as the moon reflects the sun's golden 
 light\, we\, too\, can reflect the peace\, gratitude\, and abundance we've
  cultivated throughout the season.\n\nJoin me for an evening of deep relax
 ation and renewal as healing vibrations from singing bowls\, gong\, and ch
 imes wash over you. Allow the soothing sounds to quiet the mind\, calm the
  nervous system\, and invite clarity\, balance\, and inner peace.\n\nToget
 her\, we'll honor the Full Moon as a time of reflection\, release\, and ra
 diant renewal.\n\n"Like the golden sun of late summer\, may your inner lig
 ht shine with peace\, gratitude\, and abundant joy." ✨\n\n🌕 Wednesday
 \, August 26th\n🕕 6:00 PM (Please arrive by 5:45 PM to settle in.)\n
 📍 Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n2 Science of Mind Way\, Ashevi
 lle\, NC\n\nHeld in the Sanctuary\n💛 Sliding Scale: $10–$20\n\n**Plea
 se bring:**\n🧘 Yoga mat or something comfortable to lie on\n🛏️ Bla
 nket & Pillow for extra coziness\n👀 Eye mask (optional)\n\nDoors close 
 promptly at 6:00 PM\, and seating is available on a first-come\, first-ser
 ved basis.\n\nAllow yourself this sacred time beneath the Full Moon to rel
 ease what no longer serves you\, restore your energy\, and reconnect with 
 the quiet radiance already shining within.\n\n*I look forward to sharing t
 his beautiful evening with you.*\n\n#SoundBath #FullMoon #SoundHealing #Se
 renitySoundHealing #Asheville #Meditation #Relaxation #HealingVibrations #
 InnerPeace #FullMoonMagic #GoldenLight #Abundance #ReflectionAndRenewal #A
 shevilleEvents
