SUMMARY:🌳 Sacred Synergy: Back to School Celebration for Childlike Wond
 er 🌳
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🌳 Sacred Synergy: 
 Back to School Celebration for Childlike Wonder (All Ages!) 🌳**\nCome c
 elebrate the magic of childlike wonder as we kick off the new school year 
 with music\, healing\, and community! This heart-centered gathering is for
  kids\, parents\, and anyone who wants to reconnect with their inner child
 . ✨\n\n**What to expect:**\n🎶 Sound healing & live music with Chris R
 ainbow\n🌟 Starseed sound healing with special guest Miss Ruby Timbrook 
 (9-yr-old Activist & Prayer Warrior)\n🎵 Harmonic siStar duo Anna & Anza
  Rivers weaving medicine music\n💛 Conscious Parenting talk with Kari Ri
 vers (seedsofsatya.com)\n🪘 Kids Kirtan\n💃 Kids Ecstatic Dance\n➕ M
 ore activities TBA!\n\n**🕊️ Special Announcement:**\nWe're kicking of
 f Asheville becoming a Major City for the International Children's Day of 
 PEACE (worldwide\, Nov 20th)! Learn more: foundingmothers.world/childrens-
 day-peace\n\n**📍 Location:**\nCenter for Spiritual Living\n2 Science of
  Mind Way\, Asheville\, NC 28806\n\n**📅 Date:** August 30th\n\nBring th
 e whole family for an afternoon of music\, healing\, and connection! 💫\
 n\n#SacredSynergy #Asheville #BackToSchool #ChildlikeWonder #SoundHealing 
 #ConsciousParenting #KidsKirtan #EcstaticDance #ChildrensDayOfPeace #Ashev
 illeEvents #FamilyFriendly #CommunityHealing
