 er.\n🙏 Receive a 15-minute private session focused on clarity\, alignme
 nt\, and spiritual renewal.\n🧘 A gentle\, supportive space for reflecti
 on\, prayer\, and personal connection.\n\n📝 Sign up in the Social Hall 
 or register online:\nhttps://cslasheville.breezechms.com/form/decspiritual
