SUMMARY:MASTERING MANIFESTATION: A Transformational Retreat with Dr. John 
 Waterhouse
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# MASTERING MANIFESTATI
 ON: A Transformational Retreat with Dr. John Waterhouse\n\n✨ **Awaken Yo
 ur Creative Power** ✨\nWhat if you could bring your thoughts\, beliefs\,
  and actions into greater alignment with your highest intentions?\nJoin **
 Dr. John Waterhouse** for a deeply experiential\, full-day retreat designe
 d to help you awaken your creative power and develop practical tools for c
 onscious creation.\n🌟 **RETREAT SCHEDULE**\n📅 **Saturday\, September
  12\, 2026**\n⏰ **9:00 AM – 6:00 PM**\n📍 **Center for Spiritual Liv
 ing Asheville**\n🔹 **What You’ll Experience**\n\n* 🧘 Guided medita
 tion & visioning\n* 💫 Hands-on manifestation tools\n* 🌱 Breakthrough
  exercises\n* 🧭 Exploration of core values & resources\n* 🙏 Affirmat
 ive prayer practices\n* 📝 Creating your own written daily manifestation
  plan\n* 🍽️ A nourishing midday meal included\n\n🔹 **What You’ll
  Take Home**\n\n* ✨ Greater clarity about your spiritual and personal di
 rection\n* 📝 A written manifestation plan you can incorporate into your
  daily spiritual practice\n* 🌿 Greater inner alignment and confidence\n
 * 💞 A deeper connection with a supportive spiritual community\n* 🔮 A
  deeper connection with your inner guidance\n* 🛠️ Practical tools for
  conscious creation\n\n🌟 **ABOUT DR. JOHN WATERHOUSE**\nDr. John Waterh
 ouse is an author\, spiritual teacher\, and transformational guide with de
 cades of experience in spiritual practice and community leadership. His wo
 rk invites us to explore our inner wisdom\, awaken our creative potential\
 , and consciously participate in the unfolding of our lives.\n📍 **LOCAT
 ION**\nCenter for Spiritual Living Asheville\n2 Science of Mind Way\nAshev
 ille\, NC 28806\n📞 (828) 253-2325\n💛 **CONTRIBUTION: LOVE OFFERING B
 ASIS**\nSuggested contribution: **$100 or more per participant**\nYour con
 tribution includes:\n\n* Retreat program content\n* Retreat materials\n* N
 ourishing midday meal\n\n👥 **RESERVE YOUR SPACE & BRING YOUR FRIENDS!**
 \nRSVPs are requested primarily to help us estimate the number of luncheon
  meals needed. Come spend a powerful day exploring manifestation\, spiritu
 al practice\, and conscious creation—and invite someone to experience it
  with you!\n🔗 **RSVP:** [https://cslasheville.breezechms.com/form/manif
 estation](https://cslasheville.breezechms.com/form/manifestation)\n#Master
 ingManifestation #Manifestation #SpiritualGrowth #ConsciousCreation #Spiri
 tualPractice #InnerGuidance #PersonalTransformation #CenterForSpiritualLiv
 ingAsheville #cslasheville #CommunityCommonsAsheville #SpiritualCommunity 
 #InspiredLiving
